{"id":"69fb6c23bfa0fe25","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar.md","title":"每个 DCFL 有无歧义文法","display":"thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar — 每个 DCFL 有无歧义文法","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar","aliases":["73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar"],"display":"thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar — 每个 DCFL 有无歧义文法","depends_on":["[[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]","[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§6.4, print pp. 252–257; PDF pp. 274–279; local DPDA closure/ambiguity interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§10.7, pp. 252–260; local consequence of deterministic parsing constructions","legacy_source_status":"local-corollary-proof-outline","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":6},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar — 每个 DCFL 有无歧义文法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" href=\"?note=e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton\">73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3d61b5dd7be385b\" href=\"?note=a3d61b5dd7be385b\" title=\"73-df-cfg-ambiguity\">73-df-cfg-ambiguity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§6.4, print pp. 252–257; PDF pp. 274–279; local DPDA closure/ambiguity interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§10.7, pp. 252–260; local consequence of deterministic parsing constructions"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-corollary-proof-outline"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"6"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>。DCFL 和无歧义文法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" href=\"?note=e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton\">73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a3d61b5dd7be385b\" href=\"?note=a3d61b5dd7be385b\" title=\"73-df-cfg-ambiguity\">73-df-cfg-ambiguity</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}unambiguous\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;[L(G)=L\\land\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(G)]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}unambiguous\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;[L(G)=L\\land\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(G)]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先规范化确定性机器的成功结束方式，再用带状态和栈符号的变量记录栈段计算；固定输入的计算顺序唯一，故构造的完整推导树唯一。原书 §10.7 的 LR 文法对应也给出这一事实；本条将其从“存在一台确定性机器”转成可复用的文法结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-ambiguity","status":"resolved","id":"a3d61b5dd7be385b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}$。DCFL 和无歧义文法见 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]、[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-ambiguity","status":"resolved","id":"a3d61b5dd7be385b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}$。DCFL 和无歧义文法见 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]、[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}unambiguous\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;[L(G)=L\\land\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(G)]","display":true}],"bytes":1671,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar|每个 DCFL 有无歧义文法]]"},{"id":"4e66eeecae0f34b7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}$，$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$ 且 $|\\Sigma|=4$。DCFL 见 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]；无歧义性质与原书的固有歧义见证见 [[73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar]]、[[73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness]]。"}],"outgoing":["e63e7d14efa1e2c3","a3d61b5dd7be385b"]}